  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1 — Modulo</em></p><p>You come from a different world with different knowledge of jujutsu. Rolloluca powers your techniques and you are accustomed to territorial wars. Sumerians can vary wildly in appearance, but all possess a third eye.</p>\n<p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> +2 to one ability score of your choice and +1 to another.</p>\n<p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid.</p>\n<p><strong>Age.</strong> Sumerians mature as fast as humans and live for around 100 years.</p>\n<p><strong>Alignment.</strong> Sumerians can be good, neutral, or evil, but mostly tend towards being lawful.</p>\n<p><strong>Speed.</strong> Your base walking speed is 30 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Languages.</strong> Common and Sumerian.</p><p><strong>Shaama.</strong> Little is known about the Shaama; they stay out of the battles between Deskunte and Rumelians. Size: Medium.</p>"
  },
